        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Upon graduation from the Apprenticeship Program and reclassification to a job classification listed in any of the appendices an employee shall receive seniority credit in such assigned job for continuous service in the Apprenticeship Program. In addition, such employees shall also be entitled to any seniority earned under Section B.2.",
